{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Zero-rate VAT on professional asbestos removal from domestic properties",
        "additional_details": "Removing asbestos from domestic properties can be expensive. We believe charging VAT on professional removal may encourage some homeowners to attempt DIY removal instead. A 0% VAT rate could make it more affordable to use qualified contractors and dispose of asbestos safely.",
        "background": "We want the Government to introduce a 0% VAT rate for professional asbestos removal and disposal from domestic properties, including licensed and non-licensed work, to encourage homeowners to use suitably qualified and experienced contractors.",
